_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-10-05T16:48:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:30:47Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T20:17:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nRegression reported: 4.6 works correctly; the error starts in 4.7. iOS A/B: 4.7.1.stable.official.a13da4f, Mobile / Metal. Latest 4.8 snapshot: 4.8.dev7.c971f93 (source checked; not device-tested).\n\n### System information\n\niPhone 11 - Apple A13 arm64 - iOS 26.6.1 - Mobile / Metal; Android control: API 36.1 arm64 emulator / Vulkan.\n\n### Issue description\n\nRendering is correct in Godot 4.6; the error starts in Godot 4.7. PC and Android render correctly, but iOS renders incorrectly. This commented-out line causes the problem: `// binding_cache.clear();` in `MDCommandBuffer::bind_pipeline`. [4.8 dev7 source](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c971f93e7e76b0ef919bf6009e7b868bea04db7f/drivers/metal/metal3_objects.cpp#L411-L420). Please fix this before Godot 4.8 stable. <table><tr><th>iOS, original engine</th><th>iOS, binding_cache.clear() restored</th></tr><tr><td><img width=\"320\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79a97787-1e3e-458b-af5b-210049a559ad\" /></td><td><img width=\"320\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79429a4b-7f14-4a97-a7de-f22cf8583d53\" /></td></tr></table><table><tr><th>iOS, original engine</th><th>Android</th></tr><tr><td><img width=\"320\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/031744ee-df1e-4ea2-849b-cef67f9aabe8\" /></td><td><img width=\"320\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/808ffae6-bf83-4e2d-b14a-809fe1ca43ca\" /></td></tr></table>Previous report: #124166.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n<ol><li>Open project.godot (Mobile renderer).</li><li>Export and run direct_only_transparent.tscn on iOS / Metal.</li><li>Compare direct_only_opaque.tscn and direct_only_no_sky.tscn; compare native builds with and without binding_cache.clear().</li></ol>\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nExisting water fixture, reduced to three static scenes. Mac 4.7.2 / Mobile / Metal: loaded and rendered. Reduced project on iPhone: not yet tested. Character assets are not included.\n\n[godot-metal-minimal.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33068281/godot-metal-minimal.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","